1
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:33,740
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

2
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

3
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:47,020
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

4
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:58,260
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

5
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:05,380
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

6
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:13,260
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

7
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:21,300
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

8
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:29,420
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

9
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:35,980
[Blossom in Darkness]

10
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:37,980
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

11
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:40,980
[Episode 1]

12
00:01:42,110 --> 00:01:43,890
Heaven and Earth give life to all things.

13
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:46,060
And all things have spirits.

14
00:01:46,550 --> 00:01:47,290
I

15
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,580
am a Moonlit Revival Herb,

16
00:01:50,110 --> 00:01:52,250
awakened by Danshen, master of Luoshen Valley.

17
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:53,940
He took me as his disciple

18
00:01:54,190 --> 00:01:55,620
and raised me with care and kindness.

19
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:10,200
[Danshen, Guardian of the Saintess of the Tides]

20
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:10,740
Master.

21
00:02:10,990 --> 00:02:12,200
I know what my name should be.

22
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,100
Yamao.
[*duck feather]

23
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,300
Eating a Moonlit Revival Herb

24
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:17,250
can make you immortal.

25
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:20,180
That's why so many demons covet me.

26
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:20,870
[Yamao]

27
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:21,900
[Moonlit Revival Herb Spirit]
Each night,

28
00:02:21,990 --> 00:02:22,900
bathed in moonlight,

29
00:02:23,270 --> 00:02:25,740
I'm an all-powerful herb spirit.

30
00:02:26,870 --> 00:02:27,490
But...

31
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:32,620
when daylight comes,

32
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:34,340
all my powers vanish,

33
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,570
and I'm just a helpless blade of grass.

34
00:02:52,430 --> 00:02:52,970
Found it!

35
00:02:55,420 --> 00:02:56,870
[Luoshen Residence]

36
00:02:56,870 --> 00:02:58,180
Master suffers from a chronic illness.

37
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,570
He always says

38
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,810
ordinary herbs from outside the mountains will do.

39
00:03:03,430 --> 00:03:04,180
But I know

40
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,500
that to truly ease his suffering,

41
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,090
his medicine needs my spirit essence.

42
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:28,970
Master, how are you feeling?

43
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:29,850
Does it still hurt?

44
00:03:30,390 --> 00:03:31,370
Whenever you bleed,

45
00:03:31,830 --> 00:03:32,810
you lose vital energy.

46
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,690
I didn't keep you by my side

47
00:03:34,830 --> 00:03:36,020
to hurt you.

48
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,780
As long as it heals Master,

49
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,370
what does losing some vital energy matter?

50
00:03:43,390 --> 00:03:44,090
Soon,

51
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:46,020
the Wish Tree will appear.

52
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,460
Once I hang this doll

53
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,340
that represents both of us on the tree,

54
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,970
I can stay by Master's side

55
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,690
year after year.

56
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,370
But a rain of fire from the heavens has destroyed everything.

57
00:04:14,870 --> 00:04:15,650
A thousand years ago,

58
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:18,330
the world's malice gave rise to Qi Fengyin, the Devil Incarnate.

59
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,300
Brutal and merciless,

60
00:04:20,790 --> 00:04:21,770
he slaughtered countless lives.

61
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,890
The Saintess of the Tides sealed him within Mount Qihuang.

62
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,450
Her strength exhausted,

63
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:30,620
her spirit lay dormant in a shrine in Luoshen Valley,

64
00:04:32,030 --> 00:04:33,500
which Master guarded day and night.

65
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:35,380
[Saintess's Shrine]

66
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,500
Day after day, Qi Fengyin absorbed malice

67
00:04:41,150 --> 00:04:42,100
to nourish his demonic body.

68
00:04:43,270 --> 00:04:43,810
Now,

69
00:04:44,590 --> 00:04:46,100
he is about to break through the seal again.

70
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:50,220
[Mount Zhaowu, Foremost of the Immortal Sects]

71
00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:57,780
[Yinhua, Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

72
00:04:57,780 --> 00:04:58,940
[Zhiwei, Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

73
00:04:58,940 --> 00:04:59,860
[Qingxing, Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

74
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:02,910
[Yuwen Hao, Chief Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

75
00:05:02,910 --> 00:05:03,370
Form the array!

76
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,130
No one expected

77
00:05:34,270 --> 00:05:36,810
the devil to launch a firestorm against Luoshen Valley

78
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:39,370
to destroy the Saintess's Shrine.

79
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,690
And my master,

80
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:43,660
sworn to guard her spirit,

81
00:05:44,470 --> 00:05:45,690
fought to the very end.

82
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:18,980
Master.

83
00:06:20,590 --> 00:06:21,210
Master.

84
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,060
Master...

85
00:06:22,590 --> 00:06:23,130
Master!

86
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:28,030
Master.

87
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:29,790
Master, hold on.

88
00:06:30,290 --> 00:06:31,560
I'll take you somewhere to heal in seclusion.

89
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:32,740
You're going to be all right.

90
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:33,600
Master?

91
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:37,690
Yamao.

92
00:06:39,150 --> 00:06:39,690
This...

93
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:41,250
This is...

94
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:44,300
a magical artifact I made for you.

95
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:45,740
It can mask

96
00:06:45,790 --> 00:06:48,370
your scent as a medicinal herb.

97
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,130
From now on,

98
00:06:50,830 --> 00:06:51,890
even if you're hurt,

99
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:54,660
you won't attract demons.

100
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,300
You knew something would happen to you,

101
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,250
didn't you?

102
00:07:04,830 --> 00:07:06,940
I can't always be by your side.

103
00:07:08,030 --> 00:07:09,370
There are some things

104
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,570
you have to face on your own.

105
00:07:12,470 --> 00:07:13,770
I don't want this ring.

106
00:07:15,230 --> 00:07:15,860
Master,

107
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:16,980
let me heal you.

108
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:19,210
Please don't leave me behind.

109
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:19,810
Please?

110
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,660
Go to Mount Zhaowu

111
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:24,620
and find Du Zhong.

112
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:28,060
He can protect you from now on.

113
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:29,980
I don't want Uncle Du.

114
00:07:31,590 --> 00:07:33,210
I'm not going to Mount Zhaowu.

115
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,620
I just want you, Master.

116
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:52,810
Master.

117
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,130
Master.

118
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,250
Master!

119
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:02,890
Master...

120
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,720
Master!

121
00:08:32,160 --> 00:08:33,260
Master...

122
00:09:23,350 --> 00:09:24,260
Those are heartbeats.

123
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:26,180
Master,

124
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:29,260
you're still alive, aren't you?

125
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,010
You won't just die like this.

126
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:34,060
I'll go to Mount Zhaowu right now.

127
00:09:34,930 --> 00:09:35,920
I'll find Uncle Du.

128
00:09:36,350 --> 00:09:37,610
He'll know how to save you.

129
00:09:44,870 --> 00:09:46,090
O Saintess of the Tides,

130
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,140
I have little strength

131
00:09:50,230 --> 00:09:51,670
and cannot protect you.

132
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:54,370
Your guardian is dying now.

133
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,090
If you won't save him,

134
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:59,380
I will.

135
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:13,220
[Mount Zhaowu]

136
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:17,420
Master,

137
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,180
the dark energy on Mount Qihuang is surging.

138
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:20,140
Should we

139
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:20,680
[Du Zhong]

140
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:21,810
[Leader of Mount Zhaowu]
inform High Immortal Danshen?

141
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:24,180
I'm afraid Danshen may not survive.

142
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:26,100
Qi Fengyin is about to break free.

143
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:28,210
He'll surely try to destroy the Saintess's Shrine.

144
00:10:29,750 --> 00:10:30,210
Hao,

145
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,380
go to Luoshen Valley at once

146
00:10:32,870 --> 00:10:33,660
and find out what's happened.

147
00:10:34,230 --> 00:10:35,940
You must keep the shrine intact.

148
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:36,940
Yes, Master.

149
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:38,260
You must find

150
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:39,490
Danshen's disciple.

151
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,380
She's a Moonlit Revival Herb spirit.

152
00:10:41,710 --> 00:10:43,060
By day, she's defenseless.

153
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:44,960
Without someone to protect her,

154
00:10:45,510 --> 00:10:46,780
she'll be in grave danger.

155
00:10:52,470 --> 00:10:52,940
What's wrong?

156
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:54,850
Master,

157
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,730
could you send others to find her?

158
00:10:59,110 --> 00:10:59,690
I know

159
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:01,060
you've never liked that girl.

160
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:03,090
But this is an emergency.

161
00:11:03,470 --> 00:11:04,090
Have someone

162
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:05,850
prepare the Immortal Beacon.

163
00:11:06,230 --> 00:11:07,730
Long ago, the immortal sects

164
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,060
swore a blood oath

165
00:11:09,510 --> 00:11:10,410
that whenever they see the beacon,

166
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,690
they must all assemble.

167
00:11:13,350 --> 00:11:13,830
Yes, Master.

168
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:22,740
[Summons]

169
00:11:22,940 --> 00:11:26,500
[Lin Yuemi, Leader of Shanhai Vale]

170
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:28,740
[Summons]

171
00:11:30,140 --> 00:11:33,100
[Cheng Li, Leader of Wuwang Sect]

172
00:11:34,620 --> 00:11:36,500
[Summons]

173
00:11:36,740 --> 00:11:38,660
[Cang Zhu, Leader of Luoliang Immortal Sect]

174
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:49,860
[Summons]

175
00:12:01,420 --> 00:12:05,340
[Su Hexiang, Leader of Mount Leiguan]

176
00:12:05,350 --> 00:12:06,490
The world

177
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,690
is truly about to change.

178
00:13:14,510 --> 00:13:15,570
Mount Leiguan's carriage?

179
00:13:17,470 --> 00:13:18,380
What's it doing here?

180
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:48,420
You poor girl.

181
00:13:49,630 --> 00:13:50,570
Are you the leader of Mount Leiguan,

182
00:13:51,230 --> 00:13:51,970
Su Hexiang?

183
00:13:53,870 --> 00:13:54,900
So you do remember me.

184
00:13:55,230 --> 00:13:56,610
I heard the upheaval on Mount Qihuang

185
00:13:57,470 --> 00:13:59,060
wreaked havoc on Luoshen Valley.

186
00:13:59,350 --> 00:14:01,020
My master is badly hurt.

187
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,780
I'm on my way to Mount Zhaowu

188
00:14:02,990 --> 00:14:04,140
to ask Master Du for help.

189
00:14:04,630 --> 00:14:06,660
Luoshen Valley isn't far from Mount Leiguan.

190
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:08,420
When I heard the news,

191
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:09,780
I came at once.

192
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:12,660
Now that I know you're safe,

193
00:14:13,230 --> 00:14:14,060
I can rest easy.

194
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:15,900
You there,

195
00:14:16,110 --> 00:14:17,810
help Miss Yamao into the carriage.

196
00:14:17,990 --> 00:14:18,490
Yes.

197
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:20,280
Wait.

198
00:14:21,830 --> 00:14:22,900
Madam Su,

199
00:14:24,230 --> 00:14:25,250
I left in such a hurry

200
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,850
that I forgot an important keepsake from my master.

201
00:14:27,110 --> 00:14:27,650
I...

202
00:14:27,650 --> 00:14:28,980
If it's an important keepsake,

203
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:30,730
go and get it.

204
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:42,900
Take her away.

205
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:44,690
Don't hurt her.

206
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,140
Awake already?

207
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,660
You weren't easy to catch, little herb spirit.

208
00:15:01,590 --> 00:15:02,900
Mount Leiguan is a major immortal sect,

209
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,210
one of the Five Great Sects.

210
00:15:04,590 --> 00:15:05,060
Aren't you worried

211
00:15:05,510 --> 00:15:06,730
that eating me will harm your cultivation?

212
00:15:11,510 --> 00:15:12,610
So you've already guessed

213
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:13,660
why I've come.

214
00:15:19,830 --> 00:15:21,060
Blame the fact

215
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:23,660
that your flesh can make others immortal.

216
00:15:24,870 --> 00:15:26,380
Without Danshen to protect you,

217
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,380
sooner or later,

218
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,780
someone will make a meal of you.

219
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:32,450
Why shouldn't it be me?

220
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,420
Everyone says

221
00:15:35,990 --> 00:15:37,610
you give off a medicinal scent.

222
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:39,260
Why can't I smell it?

223
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,450
Since you're so curious, Madam Su,

224
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:43,940
let me show you.

225
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,060
Has she lost her mind,

226
00:16:11,110 --> 00:16:12,540
running into Mount Qihuang?

227
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,140
Even if you hide on Mount Qihuang,

228
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:21,260
when I want something,

229
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:24,090
I never let it escape.

230
00:16:24,350 --> 00:16:24,850
After her!

231
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:28,000
Madam,

232
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:29,810
Qi Fengyin is imprisoned here.

233
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:31,180
If we go in,

234
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:34,060
can we still get back out alive?

235
00:16:34,230 --> 00:16:35,380
Qi Fengyin's been stripped of his powers

236
00:16:35,380 --> 00:16:36,260
as the Devil Incarnate.

237
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:38,180
He's nothing like he once was.

238
00:16:39,230 --> 00:16:39,840
Don't worry.

239
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:42,420
I'll stay outside and back you up.

240
00:17:00,260 --> 00:17:03,740
[Mount Qihuang]

241
00:17:05,030 --> 00:17:06,290
Mount...

242
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:07,530
Mount Qihuang?

243
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:19,420
Stay back!

244
00:17:19,710 --> 00:17:20,690
This is Mount Qihuang.

245
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:22,490
If you come any closer,

246
00:17:23,030 --> 00:17:23,730
I'll scream

247
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:24,900
and bring Qi Fengyin here.

248
00:17:25,790 --> 00:17:27,140
If I have to die,

249
00:17:27,410 --> 00:17:28,400
I'll take you down with me.

250
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:29,730
If we capture you,

251
00:17:30,270 --> 00:17:31,600
your primal spirit will survive.

252
00:17:31,750 --> 00:17:33,530
But if that devil Qi Fengyin gets you,

253
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,690
he'll tear you apart

254
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:36,800
and grind you to dust.

255
00:18:01,790 --> 00:18:02,250
Thank you...

256
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:15,860
Qi...

257
00:18:16,230 --> 00:18:16,940
Qi Fengyin!

258
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:20,030
[Qi Fengyin]

259
00:18:20,030 --> 00:18:20,490
Get lost.

260
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:34,660
Madam Su was right.

261
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,940
Without his powers as the Devil Incarnate,

262
00:18:36,990 --> 00:18:37,900
he's nothing like he once was.

263
00:18:38,470 --> 00:18:39,970
His first strike almost scared us off.

264
00:18:40,270 --> 00:18:41,290
This is a blessing in disguise.

265
00:18:41,470 --> 00:18:42,210
Let's take this chance

266
00:18:42,310 --> 00:18:43,250
and kill this devil.

267
00:18:43,790 --> 00:18:44,900
We'll be famous throughout the world!

268
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,420
While they're at each other's throats,

269
00:18:47,030 --> 00:18:48,450
I might still have a chance to escape.

270
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:52,860
Attack!

271
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:17,860
She was as good as mine.

272
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:19,820
Now Qi Fengyin gets her instead.

273
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:26,140
I...

274
00:19:27,470 --> 00:19:28,490
I'm not like them.

275
00:19:29,310 --> 00:19:30,010
You told me to leave,

276
00:19:30,550 --> 00:19:31,380
so I'll leave right away.

277
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:37,180
W... Wait.

278
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:38,000
I'll go right away.

279
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,900
I didn't tell you to leave.

280
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:00,290
Oh, no.

281
00:20:01,230 --> 00:20:02,770
Does he know what I really am?

282
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:05,080
I can't just let him devour me.

283
00:20:05,470 --> 00:20:06,660
I'll fight him to the death

284
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:08,450
and avenge Master.

285
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:21,900
Please...

286
00:20:22,550 --> 00:20:23,450
Don't get the wrong idea.

287
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:25,730
I'm trying to save you.

288
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:28,930
I can relieve your pain.

289
00:20:29,270 --> 00:20:31,020
Those black markings on your face

290
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,340
are signs of your condition.

291
00:20:32,340 --> 00:20:34,060
Do you constantly feel

292
00:20:34,230 --> 00:20:35,100
a deep, stabbing pain

293
00:20:35,230 --> 00:20:36,010
and a searing heat?

294
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,730
I know how to ease it.

295
00:20:47,750 --> 00:20:49,770
This spirit essence calms the mind

296
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:51,580
and cures every ailment in the world.

297
00:20:51,790 --> 00:20:54,340
You... You just have to drink it.

298
00:21:00,790 --> 00:21:02,290
I'm on your territory.

299
00:21:02,790 --> 00:21:04,380
I wouldn't dare cause trouble here, would I?

300
00:21:04,840 --> 00:21:06,340
If you don't believe me, you...

301
00:21:50,120 --> 00:21:51,180
You... You're welcome.

302
00:21:51,270 --> 00:21:53,180
Do you feel any better?

303
00:22:20,230 --> 00:22:20,860
Master!

304
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:30,690
Master...

305
00:22:38,070 --> 00:22:39,940
After hiding all this time,

306
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:42,340
I finally have a chance to possess a body.

307
00:22:55,180 --> 00:22:56,360
How did it end up there?

308
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:05,530
I'm sure this is the way I came in.

309
00:23:06,750 --> 00:23:08,250
Why can't I find my way out?

310
00:23:10,990 --> 00:23:11,820
I smell flowers.

311
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:14,070
Mount Qihuang is completely barren.

312
00:23:14,360 --> 00:23:15,840
I must be close to the way out.

313
00:23:56,120 --> 00:23:56,970
Qi Fengyin?

314
00:23:58,310 --> 00:23:59,660
So he's been absorbing malice

315
00:24:00,270 --> 00:24:02,010
to make that mystical flower bloom.

316
00:24:38,120 --> 00:24:39,380
That's my spirit essence.

317
00:25:26,750 --> 00:25:27,900
I didn't know this would happen.

318
00:25:28,270 --> 00:25:29,530
I really was trying to help you.

319
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:30,820
What exactly

320
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:32,840
did you come here for?

321
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:33,580
I...

322
00:25:34,230 --> 00:25:36,140
My spirit essence can calm the mind

323
00:25:37,470 --> 00:25:38,860
and ease your pain.

324
00:25:39,310 --> 00:25:40,180
But I didn't know

325
00:25:40,360 --> 00:25:41,430
it would also dispel the malice

326
00:25:41,430 --> 00:25:42,100
you'd absorbed.

327
00:25:42,100 --> 00:25:43,170
Liar.

328
00:26:02,140 --> 00:26:02,920
Stop!

329
00:26:06,790 --> 00:26:07,660
You've been absorbing malice

330
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:10,240
to make this mystical seed bloom.

331
00:26:10,680 --> 00:26:11,740
So this seed

332
00:26:12,360 --> 00:26:13,520
is as precious to you as your own life,

333
00:26:13,840 --> 00:26:14,330
isn't it?

334
00:26:19,310 --> 00:26:20,140
Put it down.

335
00:26:20,750 --> 00:26:21,770
If you spare me,

336
00:26:22,600 --> 00:26:24,130
I promise it'll be safe.

337
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:34,820
How...

338
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:35,970
How...

339
00:26:38,690 --> 00:26:39,270
How did it...?

340
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:46,330
It went into my body all by itself.

341
00:26:46,330 --> 00:26:47,150
I didn't do anything!

342
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:49,580
Qi Fengyin,

343
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:50,690
think this through.

344
00:26:51,120 --> 00:26:51,600
If you kill me,

345
00:26:51,600 --> 00:26:52,480
there'll be no one left

346
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,640
to ease your pain.

347
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:54,980
Killing me over one little seed?

348
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,220
Is it really worth it?

349
00:27:01,920 --> 00:27:04,460
Qi Fengyin, you'll regret this.

350
00:28:59,870 --> 00:29:00,290
Master.

351
00:29:01,550 --> 00:29:02,090
What did you find?

352
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:04,220
Luoshen Valley was ravaged by the firestorm

353
00:29:04,550 --> 00:29:05,740
and nearly razed to the ground.

354
00:29:06,240 --> 00:29:07,460
Luckily, the shrine is unharmed.

355
00:29:07,830 --> 00:29:08,940
I've ordered the disciples who came with me

356
00:29:09,040 --> 00:29:09,770
to stay and guard it.

357
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,500
Good. At least the shrine is safe.

358
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,420
Did you find Danshen

359
00:29:16,590 --> 00:29:17,370
and his disciple?

360
00:29:17,720 --> 00:29:19,090
I searched the entire valley

361
00:29:20,200 --> 00:29:21,610
but found no trace of either of them.

362
00:29:22,790 --> 00:29:23,610
The shrine, however,

363
00:29:23,870 --> 00:29:25,180
had been carefully concealed.

364
00:29:26,040 --> 00:29:27,460
Miss Yamao must have done it.

365
00:29:28,390 --> 00:29:29,090
Then

366
00:29:29,550 --> 00:29:30,420
she must still be alive.

367
00:29:31,440 --> 00:29:32,500
But given what she is,

368
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:34,180
once she leaves Luoshen Valley,

369
00:29:34,590 --> 00:29:36,020
she's bound to cause an uproar.

370
00:29:36,240 --> 00:29:37,020
There was little time,

371
00:29:37,350 --> 00:29:38,530
so the shrine had to come first.

372
00:29:39,170 --> 00:29:40,340
As for Miss Yamao...

373
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:48,740
Right now,

374
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:51,290
we have a more pressing matter.

375
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:57,940
Greetings, Master Du.

376
00:29:58,520 --> 00:29:59,290
The situation is dire.

377
00:29:59,630 --> 00:30:00,900
There's no need for formalities.

378
00:30:01,040 --> 00:30:02,700
Is the news sent with the Immortal Beacon

379
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:03,420
really true?

380
00:30:04,310 --> 00:30:05,420
How could the seal on Mount Qihuang

381
00:30:05,550 --> 00:30:06,740
have weakened so suddenly?

382
00:30:07,000 --> 00:30:07,610
Though Qi Fengyin

383
00:30:07,830 --> 00:30:09,090
has been confined within the mountain,

384
00:30:09,550 --> 00:30:11,140
he's spent the last millennium

385
00:30:11,140 --> 00:30:12,570
absorbing the world's malice.

386
00:30:12,830 --> 00:30:14,700
He's on the verge of becoming the Devil Incarnate.

387
00:30:19,150 --> 00:30:20,050
A thousand years ago,

388
00:30:20,870 --> 00:30:21,770
this devil

389
00:30:22,110 --> 00:30:23,940
slaughtered immortals and mortals alike.

390
00:30:24,280 --> 00:30:26,020
The mountains of corpses and rivers of blood

391
00:30:26,310 --> 00:30:27,740
are still vivid in my mind.

392
00:30:40,390 --> 00:30:41,660
We must never let him escape.

393
00:30:43,200 --> 00:30:44,660
I've summoned you all today

394
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:46,900
to reinforce the seal.

395
00:30:59,760 --> 00:31:01,330
This is the Wanjun Lock,

396
00:31:02,550 --> 00:31:04,370
a divine artifact left by the Saintess of the Tides.

397
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:07,020
Only the power of all five immortal sanctuaries can activate it.

398
00:31:07,920 --> 00:31:09,700
It can reinforce the seal on Mount Qihuang

399
00:31:10,550 --> 00:31:12,180
and stop him from absorbing any more malice.

400
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:14,090
We have to sacrifice

401
00:31:14,150 --> 00:31:15,740
the spiritual energy in our sects' sanctuaries?

402
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:17,810
Even thousands of years of cultivation

403
00:31:17,830 --> 00:31:18,770
couldn't compare to it.

404
00:31:19,520 --> 00:31:21,180
If Qi Fengyin breaks free,

405
00:31:21,630 --> 00:31:23,130
the world will never know peace.

406
00:31:23,630 --> 00:31:24,370
Our sects

407
00:31:25,070 --> 00:31:26,290
will have to answer for it.

408
00:31:29,040 --> 00:31:31,020
I was merely making a remark.

409
00:31:31,920 --> 00:31:33,050
If the nest is destroyed,

410
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:34,700
how can its eggs survive?

411
00:31:35,590 --> 00:31:36,500
Do you think

412
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:38,420
I don't understand something so simple?

413
00:31:39,150 --> 00:31:39,900
Master Du,

414
00:31:40,350 --> 00:31:41,530
just tell us

415
00:31:41,790 --> 00:31:42,850
when the Wanjun Lock

416
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:44,180
will be activated.

417
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:46,180
Everyone,

418
00:31:46,630 --> 00:31:47,980
we'll form the array at the Zi hour tonight.

419
00:31:48,390 --> 00:31:49,420
The future of the world is at stake.

420
00:31:50,350 --> 00:31:52,260
There must be no mistakes.

421
00:31:53,200 --> 00:31:53,810
Yes.

422
00:31:54,790 --> 00:31:55,090
Yes.

423
00:32:17,520 --> 00:32:18,660
Am I dead or alive?

424
00:32:30,350 --> 00:32:30,770
You...

425
00:32:31,040 --> 00:32:32,610
You know you can't escape,

426
00:32:33,550 --> 00:32:34,700
yet you keep asking for trouble.

427
00:32:45,480 --> 00:32:46,460
Qi Fengyin,

428
00:32:46,920 --> 00:32:47,660
are you insane?

429
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:49,900
You devil.

430
00:32:50,310 --> 00:32:51,130
How despicable.

431
00:32:51,760 --> 00:32:52,570
All I did was absorb

432
00:32:52,580 --> 00:32:53,530
one little seed of yours.

433
00:32:53,560 --> 00:32:54,500
And it went

434
00:32:54,520 --> 00:32:55,330
into my body by itself.

435
00:32:55,870 --> 00:32:57,180
Do you have to keep playing

436
00:32:57,280 --> 00:32:58,500
with my life like this?

437
00:32:58,760 --> 00:32:59,700
If you want me dead,

438
00:32:59,760 --> 00:33:00,660
just get it over with!

439
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,220
No, wait.

440
00:33:35,310 --> 00:33:35,740
Wait.

441
00:33:38,720 --> 00:33:39,610
Where's my leaf?

442
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:40,740
What's going on?

443
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:43,090
Has your seed

444
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:44,610
sprouted on my head?

445
00:33:45,110 --> 00:33:46,220
That's what I want to know.

446
00:33:46,870 --> 00:33:47,850
What did you do to it?

447
00:33:48,240 --> 00:33:50,050
What do you mean, what did I do to it?

448
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,700
It's your seed that's clinging to me.

449
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:52,290
I...

450
00:33:53,070 --> 00:33:54,260
Don't you dare pull it out.

451
00:34:06,480 --> 00:34:07,900
You were going to kill me.

452
00:34:08,520 --> 00:34:10,610
But it grew on my head

453
00:34:11,110 --> 00:34:12,340
and turned me into its flowerpot.

454
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:12,980
That's why

455
00:34:13,670 --> 00:34:14,690
you saved me, isn't it?

456
00:34:15,070 --> 00:34:16,380
The less you talk,

457
00:34:16,920 --> 00:34:18,170
the longer I'll let you live.

458
00:34:19,230 --> 00:34:19,860
Fine.

459
00:34:20,670 --> 00:34:21,940
If you won't answer,

460
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:24,730
I'll find out for myself.

461
00:34:32,480 --> 00:34:33,610
I see.

462
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:35,570
Your precious seed's life

463
00:34:35,630 --> 00:34:37,130
is tied to mine now.

464
00:34:37,750 --> 00:34:39,780
So not only do you have to keep me alive...

465
00:34:42,190 --> 00:34:43,420
Ow! That hurts!

466
00:34:44,070 --> 00:34:44,760
Please, sir!

467
00:34:45,330 --> 00:34:46,170
Spare me!

468
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:52,020
As long as I keep you alive,

469
00:34:52,550 --> 00:34:54,500
my seed will be fine.

470
00:34:55,230 --> 00:34:56,530
I was only joking.

471
00:34:59,960 --> 00:35:01,860
"A Guide to Mystical Flower Care"?

472
00:35:02,190 --> 00:35:04,420
Is this for taking care of the seed?

473
00:35:05,440 --> 00:35:06,730
So it's called a mystical flower.

474
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:09,050
You don't even know

475
00:35:09,110 --> 00:35:10,210
what your own flower is called?

476
00:35:14,630 --> 00:35:16,370
Despite not knowing what the flower

477
00:35:16,370 --> 00:35:16,880
is called,

478
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:17,610
you've managed

479
00:35:17,610 --> 00:35:18,820
to grow such a lovely flower.

480
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:20,130
You have a real gift, sir.

481
00:35:28,270 --> 00:35:29,610
Do you recognize these little black dots

482
00:35:30,230 --> 00:35:30,900
on the pages?

483
00:35:31,070 --> 00:35:31,940
Black dots?

484
00:35:32,040 --> 00:35:33,610
You mean these words?

485
00:35:36,070 --> 00:35:37,420
You can't read?

486
00:35:38,520 --> 00:35:39,210
Can you read them?

487
00:35:40,840 --> 00:35:41,380
Yes.

488
00:35:41,630 --> 00:35:42,300
Of course I can.

489
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:47,690
"Mystical flowers thrive in ground rich in spiritual energy

490
00:35:48,150 --> 00:35:50,170
and can choose fertile soil on their own.

491
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:51,650
Within 12 hours,

492
00:35:51,800 --> 00:35:53,170
they put down deep roots."

493
00:35:54,880 --> 00:35:56,380
Fertile soil, huh?

494
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:58,170
So it really is using me as a flowerpot.

495
00:35:58,670 --> 00:35:59,460
What is fertile soil?

496
00:36:02,750 --> 00:36:04,050
It means

497
00:36:06,360 --> 00:36:07,610
good soil.

498
00:36:10,630 --> 00:36:11,780
You're not good soil.

499
00:36:12,400 --> 00:36:13,340
If I'm not good soil,

500
00:36:13,750 --> 00:36:14,530
why is the mystical flower

501
00:36:14,590 --> 00:36:15,380
growing out of my head?

502
00:36:15,550 --> 00:36:16,130
Keep reading.

503
00:36:18,520 --> 00:36:19,620
"Mystical flowers are delicate

504
00:36:19,620 --> 00:36:20,980
and must never be transplanted by force.

505
00:36:21,670 --> 00:36:22,650
If transplanting is unavoidable,

506
00:36:22,670 --> 00:36:23,780
follow the instructions in this guide.

507
00:36:24,270 --> 00:36:25,300
Never pull the plant out by force.

508
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:26,780
Only at midnight,

509
00:36:27,040 --> 00:36:27,860
when all things are renewed,

510
00:36:28,040 --> 00:36:28,980
may you attempt it.

511
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:31,690
Once a mystical flower has taken deep root,

512
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:33,940
it must never be transplanted.

513
00:36:34,110 --> 00:36:36,090
Keep this in mind at all times."

514
00:36:37,070 --> 00:36:38,380
So at midnight,

515
00:36:39,480 --> 00:36:41,130
I can still transplant it back.

516
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:43,980
Transplant it back?

517
00:36:44,440 --> 00:36:45,020
No way.

518
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:46,430
I've managed to offend

519
00:36:46,430 --> 00:36:47,690
Qi Fengyin in every possible way.

520
00:36:48,040 --> 00:36:49,500
The flower growing on my head

521
00:36:49,550 --> 00:36:50,860
is the only reason I'm still alive.

522
00:36:51,320 --> 00:36:52,780
If he really takes the flower away,

523
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:54,090
he won't let me live.

524
00:36:54,920 --> 00:36:55,860
Try running again,

525
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:57,900
and I'll cripple you on the spot.

526
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:06,340
I was kind enough to read the guide to you.

527
00:37:06,710 --> 00:37:08,460
You can't just kill me once I've served my purpose.

528
00:37:14,190 --> 00:37:15,170
Once my powers return tonight,

529
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:16,530
I'll find a way to escape.

530
00:37:16,820 --> 00:37:18,780
[Mount Zhaowu]

531
00:37:20,270 --> 00:37:21,090
The Zi hour is almost upon us.

532
00:37:21,630 --> 00:37:23,020
Tell every sect to get ready to form the array.

533
00:37:36,630 --> 00:37:37,210
It's night now.

534
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:59,340
Is it midnight already?

535
00:38:10,270 --> 00:38:11,500
The guide lists so many warnings

536
00:38:11,550 --> 00:38:12,650
about transplanting mystical flowers.

537
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:14,300
That means it's dangerous.

538
00:38:14,590 --> 00:38:15,570
Why are you so determined

539
00:38:15,630 --> 00:38:16,340
to separate it from me?

540
00:38:17,070 --> 00:38:18,500
I've only known you for a day.

541
00:38:19,550 --> 00:38:20,820
How many times have you lied to me already?

542
00:38:23,630 --> 00:38:24,380
I don't trust you.

543
00:38:24,440 --> 00:38:25,530
We may have had a few

544
00:38:25,530 --> 00:38:26,130
unpleasant moments,

545
00:38:26,630 --> 00:38:27,340
but I've always been

546
00:38:27,440 --> 00:38:28,380
generous and forgiving.

547
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,090
I don't hold grudges.

548
00:38:29,270 --> 00:38:30,730
I promise I'll take good care of your flower.

549
00:38:30,840 --> 00:38:31,690
Besides, don't you get lonely

550
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:33,090
all by yourself on Mount Qihuang?

551
00:38:33,270 --> 00:38:33,980
Why not keep me alive

552
00:38:34,110 --> 00:38:35,170
so you have someone to talk to?

553
00:38:36,070 --> 00:38:37,460
I don't want to hear you talk.

554
00:38:45,520 --> 00:38:46,570
I haven't finished reading

555
00:38:46,920 --> 00:38:48,340
that flower care guide to you yet.

556
00:39:07,520 --> 00:39:08,500
Why is the doll I made for Master

557
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:09,680
moving?

558
00:39:09,750 --> 00:39:11,250
This is the body I want.

559
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:12,210
Don't touch her!

560
00:39:13,070 --> 00:39:13,900
That voice

561
00:39:14,800 --> 00:39:15,860
sounds so familiar.

562
00:39:24,270 --> 00:39:25,820
Why is my malice in that thing?

563
00:39:55,070 --> 00:39:55,940
Has the mystical flower...?

564
00:39:56,150 --> 00:39:56,780
It's taken root.

565
00:39:59,880 --> 00:40:00,840
If you kill me,

566
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:02,340
your flower will never bloom.

567
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:10,130
Why are you carrying my malice?

568
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:11,860
I've been watching closely.

569
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:13,250
Earlier, the malice inside you

570
00:40:13,360 --> 00:40:14,590
was dispersed by her spirit essence.

571
00:40:14,630 --> 00:40:16,500
I was so desperate to possess someone

572
00:40:16,710 --> 00:40:18,170
and so greedy

573
00:40:18,400 --> 00:40:19,130
for a normal body

574
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,300
that I accidentally

575
00:40:20,320 --> 00:40:21,420
attracted a wisp of your malice,

576
00:40:21,420 --> 00:40:22,300
which latched onto me.

577
00:40:23,320 --> 00:40:24,130
And the rest of my malice?

578
00:40:24,440 --> 00:40:25,980
It's already drifted out of Mount Qihuang.

579
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:27,780
You'll have to go outside to find it.

580
00:40:28,230 --> 00:40:30,130
Once you reclaim all that malice,

581
00:40:30,320 --> 00:40:30,820
