582
00:40:30,850 --> 00:40:32,870
at full strength.

583
00:40:32,870 --> 00:40:34,350
Then you'll have all the power you need

584
00:40:34,350 --> 00:40:35,380
to make the mystical flower bloom.

585
00:40:36,270 --> 00:40:36,780
As for the mystical flower,

586
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:37,940
whether it grows in soil

587
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:39,020
or on her head

588
00:40:39,170 --> 00:40:40,210
makes no difference.

589
00:40:40,210 --> 00:40:41,460
I'm telling the truth.

590
00:40:41,590 --> 00:40:44,210
I'm a mighty ancient demon.

591
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:45,300
There's nothing

592
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:47,380
I don't know about this world.

593
00:40:47,520 --> 00:40:48,820
Right now, the best thing you can do

594
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:49,250
is

595
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:52,250
leave Mount Qihuang.

596
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:01,460
The Wanjun Lock...

597
00:41:02,360 --> 00:41:03,130
The immortal sects have begun

598
00:41:03,150 --> 00:41:03,980
reinforcing the seal.

599
00:42:35,070 --> 00:42:35,820
If you're here,

600
00:42:35,920 --> 00:42:36,730
how will you handle the Wanjun Lock?

601
00:42:36,920 --> 00:42:38,690
Just make sure the mystical flower stays safe.

602
00:42:42,320 --> 00:42:43,980
Where's that woman who's carrying

603
00:42:44,320 --> 00:42:44,980
my malice?

604
00:42:45,440 --> 00:42:46,130
Mount Leiguan.

605
00:42:48,710 --> 00:42:49,050
Someone...

606
00:42:50,480 --> 00:42:51,170
I really have no

607
00:42:51,190 --> 00:42:52,090
improper intentions toward you.

608
00:42:52,150 --> 00:42:53,300
I just want you to take me away!

609
00:43:13,660 --> 00:43:17,700
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

610
00:43:17,940 --> 00:43:21,380
♪So many longings♪

611
00:43:22,060 --> 00:43:24,140
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

612
00:43:24,340 --> 00:43:29,340
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

613
00:43:30,260 --> 00:43:34,300
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

614
00:43:34,540 --> 00:43:37,980
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

615
00:43:38,660 --> 00:43:40,740
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

616
00:43:40,940 --> 00:43:48,340
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

617
00:43:49,740 --> 00:43:53,420
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

618
00:43:53,660 --> 00:43:57,340
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

619
00:43:57,980 --> 00:44:01,540
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

620
00:44:01,860 --> 00:44:06,020
♪Still waits to come true♪

621
00:44:06,260 --> 00:44:09,940
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

622
00:44:10,500 --> 00:44:14,140
♪I'll stay by your side♪

623
00:44:14,620 --> 00:44:18,220
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

624
